---
import fs from 'node:fs';
import path from 'node:path';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import '../styles/gallery-style.css';

const galleryPath = './public/gallery';

const imageFiles = fs.readdirSync(galleryPath)
  .filter(file =>
    ['.jpg', '.jpeg', '.png', '.webp', '.heic'].includes(path.extname(file).toLowerCase())
  )
  .map(file => {
    const filePath = path.join(galleryPath, file);
    const stats = fs.statSync(filePath);
    return {
      file,
      mtime: stats.mtime
    };
  })
  .sort((a, b) => b.mtime.getTime() - a.mtime.getTime());
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ro">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Galeria Fotograma.ro</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet">
</head>
<header>
  <Header />
</header>
<body>
  <main>
    <section class="gallery-intro">
      <h1>Galeria Fotograma.ro</h1>
      <p>
        In aceasta sectiune a site-ului nostru, veti gasi o selectie de fotografii atent alese care reflecta viziunea si creativitatea noastra. Fiecare imagine spune o poveste unica, capturand momente speciale si emotii autentice. Va invitam sa explorati galeria noastra mai jos. Pentru includerea fotografiilor dumneavoastra in galeria noastra, va rugam sa ne contactati la adresa de email:
        <a href="mailto:fotogramacontact@gmail.com">fotogramacontact@gmail.com</a>
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="masonry-gallery">
      {imageFiles.map(({ file }) => (
        <a href={`/gallery/${file}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="image-item">
          <img src={`/gallery/${file}`} alt="Galerie Foto" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
      ))}
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</body>
</html>